      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FUGENZO (2) goes very well this trip starting nine times for three wins and three minors. In the money last time at Gosford (22.41) in a Grade 5, finishing a 2.5 lengths third. Looks suited here and rates on top. HOUDINI ESCAPE (3) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by 3.5 lengths at this track in a handy 18.46 beating Adamant Andy. Was a winner at his only start from this draw. Bold showing expected again. MY ROADSTER BOY (4) is rarely out of the finish, recording 12 places from 20 starts. Finished second (18.33) at this track latest and might be close to finding winning form again. Expecting another good run. TAP OUT BOSTON (1) is among the chances again if he runs up to the latest effort.",
